{"product_id":"kamui-roku-premium-chalk","title":"KAMUI ROKU Premium Chalk","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMaximum Grip. Precise Control. Expanded Sweet Spot.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eKAMUI ROKU\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a premium Japanese billiard chalk engineered for players who demand exceptional grip, reliable adhesion, and precise cue-ball control. Its ultra-fine particle formulation is designed to maximize friction between the cue tip and cue ball, giving players greater confidence and consistency when applying English and demanding spin.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe name \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e“ROKU,” meaning “six” in Japanese\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, reflects its distinctive hexagonal shape and the hexagonal close-packing concept behind its development. This unique approach brings together performance-focused engineering and distinctive design in a chalk developed for serious players.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhy Choose KAMUI ROKU?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHigh Grip Power\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Provides strong friction between the cue tip and cue ball\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExcellent Adhesion\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Fine particles adhere effectively to the tip for reliable coverage\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUltra-Fine Particles\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Designed to promote strong grip and an expanded effective contact area\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExpanded Sweet Spot\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Helps maintain control when striking the cue ball with English\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHigh Solidity\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Dense construction helps provide consistent application and durability\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eGreater Spin Control\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Strong tip-to-ball friction supports demanding English, draw, and follow shots\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eReduced Chalk Transfer\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Designed to minimize unwanted residue on the cue ball and cloth\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eJapanese Precision\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e — Developed in Japan with a performance-focused particle structure\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe ROKU Advantage\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eGrip\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e gives you the confidence to attack the cue ball.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAdhesion\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e helps keep the tip properly covered without excessive application.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSolidity\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e provides a dense, consistent chalk designed for easy application and lasting performance.\u0